{
  "global_prompt": "Whimsical hand-drawn cartoon illustration style with soft watercolor textures and bold ink outlines, painterly storybook aesthetic. The protagonist Tiaoye is a young girl around eight years old, shoulder-length chestnut brown hair, large round brown eyes, freckles across her cheeks, wearing a dark charcoal grey wizard-style long coat over a white collared shirt with a small red and gold striped scarf at her neck and brown boots, carrying a small worn leather satchel at her hip. The central magical artifact is an old leather-bound spellbook with embossed glowing blue runes on its cover, the open pages emit a gentle inner blue glow, blue cyan rune symbols drift and spiral through the air around it like floating glyphs. Settings transition between two locations connected by magical teleportation: a vast ancient magical bookstore with towering wooden bookshelves, honey-toned wood floors, a tall pointed gothic window pouring warm golden afternoon sunlight, suspended dust motes; and an underground crystal cavern with ancient stone gothic ruins, mossy stone bridges over a small luminous stream, glowing pink and blue bioluminescent mushrooms, drooping moss vines from cavern ceiling, an arched stone doorway glowing with soft warm light, pastel pink and blue glowing butterflies fluttering. Cinematic depth, gentle ambient floating particles, painterly storybook atmosphere, no text, no watermark.",
  "local_prompts": "Shot 1 medium wide shot of Tiaoye standing at the center of the bookstore aisle with a slow steady push-in dolly. She holds the open leather spellbook in both hands at chest height as glowing blue rune symbols stream out from the pages and spiral upward around her body, then her coat hem and hair lift gently in the swirling magical wind while her brown eyes widen and her gaze locks down onto the glowing pages. The warm sepia bookstore light remains the dominant key across the wooden shelves while the book's cool blue glow forms a contained accent only around her hands and face. She declares with breathless wonder '黑暗森林，带我去！', her chin lifting slightly as her shoulders rise in a sharp inhale, lips parted softly, fingers tightening on the book's edges. audio: warm magical resonance swelling, layered crystalline chimes, soft paper flutter, ambient bookstore hush. | Continuing seamlessly from the previous moment in the same continuous take, Shot 2 medium wide shot at a slight low angle with a gentle lateral tracking move drifting right. The swirling blue magical particles dissipate as the cavern materializes around her, then Tiaoye stands in profile at the threshold of the underground crystal cavern with her left arm hanging loose at her side, her head turning slowly to face the glowing arched stone doorway ahead while her lips part in disbelief. The warm amber glow from the distant archway dominates the scene as the singular key light, with cool teal cavern shadows filling the foreground. She exclaims softly '这，这是哪儿？', her shoulders lifting in a small startled breath, eyebrows pulling upward, brown eyes widening as her gaze drifts toward what is about to unfold. audio: low ambient cavern reverb, faint dripping water, soft magical chime fading, distant resonant hum. | Continuing seamlessly from the previous moment in the same continuous take, Shot 3 extreme close-up on Tiaoye's face with a slow push-in and subtle handheld breathing. Lingering blue rune symbols drift past her freckled cheeks as the residual magical light shimmers across her skin, then her brown eyes go wide and round, her pupils slightly dilated, while her cheeks flush pink and her lips part in stunned disbelief. The soft warm sepia glow from the blurred bookstore window remains the dominant key across her face with the cool blue rune light forming small accent flickers on her skin. She breathes out in stunned wonder '我，被传送了？', her chin trembling faintly, lower lip quivering, brows drawn upward as her gaze searches for what is about to unfold. audio: quiet held breath, faint magical shimmer particles, gentle heartbeat thump, low ambient hum settling. | Continuing seamlessly from the previous moment in the same continuous take, Shot 4 medium wide tracking shot following her from the side at a low angle, camera dollying laterally to keep pace with her steps. Tiaoye walks forward across the mossy stone bridge holding the open glowing spellbook in both hands at chest height, then a pastel pink butterfly flutters across the foreground as her brown boots step softly on the worn stone while glowing pink and blue mushrooms line the bridge edges. The warm amber glow from the distant arched doorway dominates the scene as the singular key light, painting her coat and the bridge in soft golden tones. She wonders aloud '原来，这就是黑暗森林？', her chin lifting in cautious awe, lips parting softly into a small uncertain smile, eyes shining with reflected light as her shoulders settle into careful resolve. audio: gentle footsteps on stone, soft butterfly wing flutter, faint cavern echo, magical ambient resonance, distant water trickle.",
