  "global_prompt": "Whimsical hand-drawn cartoon illustration style with soft watercolor textures and bold ink outlines, painterly storybook fantasy aesthetic. Setting is a vast underground crystal cavern with ancient gothic stone ruins, mossy stone bridges arching over a small luminous stream and waterfall, towering glowing yellow blue and purple bioluminescent mushrooms scattered throughout, drooping green moss vines from the cavern ceiling, a distant ancient gothic stone archway doorway glowing with warm amber light at the far end. The protagonist Tiaoye is a young girl around eight years old, shoulder-length chestnut brown hair, large round brown eyes, freckles across her cheeks, wearing a dark charcoal grey wizard-style long coat over a white collared shirt with a small red and gold striped scarf at her neck and brown boots. She carries an old leather-bound spellbook with embossed glowing blue runes on its cover, the open pages emit a gentle inner blue glow with cyan rune symbols drifting around it. Pastel pink, blue and yellow glowing butterflies flutter through the cavern air. Cinematic depth, gentle ambient floating particles, painterly storybook atmosphere, dominant cool teal cavern light with warm amber accents from the distant doorway, no text, no watermark.",
  "local_prompts": "Shot 1 extreme wide establishing shot of the vast crystal cavern with a slow steady push-in dolly. Tiny in scale at the center of the frame, Tiaoye stands on the mossy stone bridge holding the glowing spellbook at chest height as her head tilts slowly upward to take in the towering glowing mushrooms around her, then ambient blue particles drift gently across the cavern while soft mist curls along the bridge stones. Cool teal cavern light dominates the entire frame with warm amber glow from the distant archway forming a localized accent at the far end. She gasps in wonder '哇，好美！一点也不黑暗啊！', her shoulders rising in a small awed inhale, lips parted softly into a delighted smile, her free hand lifting slightly as her gaze drifts toward what is about to unfold. audio: gentle cavern wind, soft water trickle, faint magical chime resonance, distant ambient cave reverb. | Continuing seamlessly from the previous moment in the same continuous take, Shot 2 medium shot of Tiaoye on the bridge from a slight low angle with a subtle handheld breathing camera. She holds the open glowing spellbook in both hands at chest height as the pages riffle gently on their own, then a pink butterfly flutters past her left shoulder while a yellow butterfly drifts behind her head and cyan rune symbols spiral up from the open pages. The cool teal cavern light remains the dominant key across the scene with the book's blue glow forming a contained accent on her hands and face. She declares with excited certainty '魔法书在给我指路！', her chin lifting as her shoulders settle back, lips parting into a confident small smile, fingers tightening on the book's edges as her gaze drops to follow the rune trail. audio: soft butterfly wing flutter, gentle paper riffling, layered crystalline magical chimes, ambient cavern hum. | Continuing seamlessly from the previous moment in the same continuous take, Shot 3 extreme close-up on Tiaoye's face with a slow push-in. She tilts her chin upward as a soft column of blue light rises from the open spellbook below her chin, then her brown eyes go wide and bright with joy while drifting cyan rune symbols glow around her freckled cheeks. The book's cool blue glow dominates her face from below as the singular key light, with the cavern blurred and softly desaturated behind her. She exclaims with delighted certainty '找到方向啦！就在前面！', her cheeks lifting in a wide open-mouthed grin, eyes crinkling at the corners, lips parting into bright excitement as her chest rises in a happy breath. audio: bright magical resonance swelling, layered crystalline chimes, joyful breath of laughter, soft particle shimmer. | Continuing seamlessly from the previous moment in the same continuous take, Shot 4 medium wide shot from behind Tiaoye with a slow upward tilt revealing the gothic archway. She walks forward across the mossy stone bridge in silhouette holding the glowing spellbook at her side, then her boots step softly along the worn stones while a small waterfall trickles down the right side of the bridge and the archway grows larger in the frame ahead. The warm amber glow pouring from the distant gothic archway dominates the scene as the singular key light, casting her small silhouette in soft golden rim light. She calls out with bright determined courage '黑暗森林之门，我来啦！', her chin lifting as her shoulders square forward, lips parting into a brave smile, her stride lengthening slightly with confident purpose. audio: gentle footsteps on stone, soft waterfall trickle, distant magical hum swelling, ambient cavern reverb, faint adventurous melodic resonance.",
